From 6f275d404aeccc281397846725004a9fab84b6a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: port <port@local>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 20:00:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 16/32] ww3d2, stage 1: the 49 files that don't use Direct3D

- extra qualifications removed (15, automated), loop scoping (8, automated)
- this->/using/typename for dependent bases (dllist.h, prim_anim.h)
- writable-buffer fixes where strings are truncated in place (hmorphanim, rendobj)
- lightenvironment: untyped statics were int (0) in the shipped game; type made explicit,
  shipped value kept
- port layer: lstrcpy/lstrcpyn/lstrcat/lstrlen/lstrcmpi/lstrcpynW, GetCurrentDirectory (D:\),
  strupr/strlwr, _isnan
